function renderPurchases(){const grouped=new Map();for(const move of stockMovements){const date=movementDate(move);if((move.type!=="in"&&move.type!=="initial")||date<range.start||date>range.end)continue;const stock=stocks.find(x=>x.id===move.stockItemId)||{id:move.stockItemId,name:move.stockName||"Stok",unitsPerPackage:move.unitsPerPackage||1,packageUnit:"koli"},key=stock.id||move.stockName,current=grouped.get(key)||{name:stock.name||move.stockName||"Stok",packages:0,units:0,total:0,entries:0};current.packages+=movementPackages(move,stock);current.units+=num(move.amount);current.total+=movementPurchase(move,stock);current.entries++;grouped.set(key,current)}const items=[...grouped.values()].sort((a,b)=>b.total-a.total||a.name.localeCompare(b.name,"tr")),packages=items.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.packages,0),units=items.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.units,0),total=items.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.total,0);el.purchaseProductCount.textContent=formatNumber(items.length);el.purchasePackageCount.textContent=formatNumber(packages);el.purchaseUnitCount.textContent=formatNumber(units);el.allPurchaseTotal.textContent=money(total);el.purchaseList.innerHTML=items.map(x=>`<article class="purchase-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked"></i><div><strong>${esc(x.name)}</strong><small>${x.entries} Stok Girişi • ${formatNumber(x.packages)} Koli • ${formatNumber(x.units)} Adet</small></div><b>${money(x.total)}</b></article>`).join("");el.purchaseEmpty.hidden=items.length>0}
